From 9dee307ebc7cdb972fde83ceea55b7c197793eeb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 18:17:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(login): enlarge ZI so its feet land on the form's bottom
 line
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Bottom-aligns the two gateway zones (align-items:end) and grows the ZI character
(height clamp up to 760px) so the character's feet sit on the same baseline as the
bottom of the login card — a grounded, more present welcome. The character PNG is
trimmed of its transparent padding (623×895) so its feet reach the image edge and
the alignment is exact. Still fits 100vh without scroll at 1920/1440/1366 and
stacks unchanged on mobile. No auth logic touched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cm5NAh92cekdimerQbEsCW
---
 public/characters/zi/zi-login-access.png | Bin 417679 -> 404427 bytes
 src/app/(auth)/login/LoginExperience.tsx |   4 ++--
 src/app/globals.css                      |   4 ++--
 3 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

